then I would've...

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:07.720
...never thought that being happy
was the most important thing.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:22.060
Huh? Did you just get here?

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:25.610
I'm sorry. I was with my friends
longer than I expected.

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.680
Hey, what about a baby?

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:28.150
Hey, what about a baby?
Huh?

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:29.180
Not yet...

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.110
I see.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:34.450
But I'm sure God will...

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.110
But I'm sure God will...
I'm sorry, Yura.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:41.550
I'm sure you must be nervous
having dinner with my family.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:48.690
But I never thought you could
marry a beautiful woman like her.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.270
You're being rude!

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:53.600
What kind of man
do you want to marry, Jun?

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:56.770
Someone who's totally
different from my brother.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:14.790
I wanted to come visit you
when you were still a student.

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:19.760
I feel the same way.

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:46.620
No, it feels different...

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:49.350
We can't do it here...

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:51.100
We'll just do it quietly...

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:01.040
What's wrong?

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:07.240
What? Yura!

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:24.090
No, I'm about to...

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:46.020
Amazing, it's better than usual.

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:50.250
I climaxed once, so I can go on longer.

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:52.250
Does it feel good, Yura?

00:23:52.390 --> 00:23:53.090
Yes!

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:56.220
It feels so good!

00:24:17.850 --> 00:24:18.820
Yura...

00:24:21.390 --> 00:24:23.820
I think I'm happy.

00:24:27.160 --> 00:24:28.460
Me too.

00:24:45.940 --> 00:24:54.180
You try to make it look
as if nothing is wrong.

00:24:55.690 --> 00:25:02.750
The knife of love won't show any mercy.

00:25:03.500 --> 00:25:11.990
You just hold back your feelings
and live each and everyday.

00:25:13.110 --> 00:25:20.010
You say you're used to it or
there's nothing you can do.

00:25:21.810 --> 00:25:25.380
We should be much
more straightforward...

00:25:26.150 --> 00:25:29.520
...and hug each other real tight.

00:25:30.060 --> 00:25:34.650
Even if we're feeling
awkward at times.

00:25:34.890 --> 00:25:42.960
On the night when I dream
as many times as I shed tears...

00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:51.910
...l'm sure an angel will smile at me.

00:25:52.380 --> 00:26:00.580
Let's dream of all the stars in the sky.

00:26:01.090 --> 00:26:09.520
I hope you keep on smiling.

00:26:09.900 --> 00:26:17.960
Let's dream of all the stars in the sky.

00:26:34.050 --> 00:26:35.520
Next episode

00:26:43.430 --> 00:26:46.890
Our next door neighbors
won the lottery and...

00:26:47.000 --> 00:26:50.300
...they invited us to
go on a trip with them.

00:26:50.970 --> 00:26:55.740
Makoto's cousin Kyoko
also comes along with us.

00:26:56.310 --> 00:26:58.800
Makoto and Yura try to
make love at their hotel...

00:26:58.880 --> 00:27:01.370
...but are worried
about their surroundings.

00:27:01.680 --> 00:27:06.670
Can they move forward
in this step up love story?

00:27:07.550 --> 00:27:11.350
Step Up Love Story 2.
Part 1-White Lovers.

00:27:11.790 --> 00:27:15.990
I want you to love only me, Makoto.
